sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Strategy (evaluate)
    participant MD as MarketData
    participant X as Executor
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant D as Deribit
    participant J as orders.log
    participant SM as StateManager

    S->>S: occupiedSlots() — strangles + pending entries
    S->>S: margin policy: IM limit (DVOL band / negative gamma), frozen?, MM limit
    S->>X: GetAccountSummary → Deribit IM, MM, margin balance
    S->>S: frozen or margin unknown → skip · headroom = limit × margin balance − IM
    S->>MD: AllInstruments()
    S->>S: slotExpiry (ExpiryWindow, fallback if occupied) · SelectStrike(call/put, |Δ| ≈ target)
    S->>X: SimulatePortfolio(+1 lot call & put) → IM per lot → lots for this slot's share
    S->>X: SimulatePortfolio(final size) → post-trade IM ≤ limit and MM ≤ max_mm_pct, else shrink or skip
    S->>S: premium floor + GEX gate (skip a leg only when the regime sheds it)
    S->>X: Submit sell call limit @ max(mid, ask)
    X->>GW: Call(private/sell, low priority)
    GW->>D: private/sell
    D-->>GW: order_id, filled_amount
    GW-->>X: reply (routed by request ID)
    X-->>S: Fill
    S->>J: LogSubmit
    S->>X: Submit sell put limit (if the put fails → abandonPending keeps any filled call)
    S->>S: addPending(pendingStrangle)

    loop each cycle until done or timeout
        S->>X: GetOrderState(order)
        X-->>S: state, filled_amount, avg price
        alt ask drifted > order_slippage_pct
            S->>X: AmendOrder(new ask) (≤ order_max_adjustments)
        end
    end

    alt every leg filled
        S->>SM: AddPosition(legs at filled qty) + AddStrangle
        S->>J: LogOpen
    else order_fill_timeout_sec elapsed
        S->>X: Cancel unfilled legs
        S->>X: GetOrderState (capture fills that raced the cancel)
        S->>J: LogCancelled
        S->>SM: book filled legs (one-legged strangle → repair completes it)
    end
